flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[Show start screen]
 B --> C{Enter or tap?}
 C -- No --> B
 C -- Yes --> D[Reset game and create mission]
 D --> E[Process input and update frame]
 E --> F[Move player, traffic and destination]
 F --> G{Collision?}
 G -- Yes --> H[Deduct life and 20 points]
 G -- No --> I{At drop zone and stopped?}
 H --> J{Lives remaining?}
 J -- No --> K[Show game over and best score]
 J -- Yes --> I
 I -- Yes --> L[Award fare, increment level, new mission]
 I -- No --> M{Missed stop zone?}
 L --> N[Render frame and HUD]
 M -- Yes --> O[Deduct 50 points and new mission]
 M -- No --> N
 O --> N
 N --> P{Paused?}
 P -- Yes --> Q[Wait for resume]
 Q --> E
 P -- No --> E
 K --> R{Restart?}
 R -- Yes --> D
 R -- No --> S([End])
